# anthropic_vault (Data Source)

Retrieves a vault by ID (beta), for example one created in another configuration or in the Console, to attach credentials to it. Works regardless of whether the vault is archived.

> **API**: `GET /v1/vaults/{vault_id}` (Managed Agents API).
> **Auth**: Standard API key (`api_key` / `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`).
> **Beta header**: `anthropic-beta: managed-agents-2026-04-01`.
> **Cost**: Free.

